# What stays out of the .vsix.
#
# The extension ships the built output and the two documents a reader needs.
# Sources, tests and build configuration are in the repository for anyone who
# wants them, and shipping them would put this package's test fixtures on
# somebody's machine for no reason.
src/**
test/**
tsconfig.json
**/*.map
**/*.ts
!dist/**/*.js
node_modules/**
